<header><p class="st-kicker">kingdom · British Isles</p><h1 class="st-title">Kingdom of Moylurg</h1><p class="st-meta">1100 CE – 1585 CE (approx.) · capital Rock of Lough Ce</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">A Gaelic lordship of north Roscommon ruled by the MacDermots from their island fortress on Lough Key.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>Magh Luirg was the territory of a branch of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sil-muiredaig">Sil Muiredaig</a>, the ruling kindred of <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/kingdom-of-connacht">Connacht</a>. In the 12th century the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/macdermot">MacDermot</a> family, descended from Diarmait mac Taidg, emerged as its rulers and as marshals of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ua-conchobair-dynasty">O'Connor</a> kings of Connacht.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/macdermot">MacDermots</a> ruled from the Rock of Lough Ce, an island fortress on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lough-key">Lough Key</a>, and patronised the abbey of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/boyle-abbey">Boyle</a> and the learned families who compiled the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/annals-of-loch-ce">Annals of Loch Ce</a>. Their lordship was based on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cattle">cattle</a>, clients and armed retainers, and they served as kingmakers in <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/kingdom-of-connacht">Connacht</a> politics.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/composition-of-connacht">Composition of Connacht</a> in 1585 brought the lordship under English land law. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/macdermot">MacDermots</a> kept part of their lands and their title, the MacDermot, Prince of Coolavin, has been recognised into modern times.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="kingdom, 1100 CE – 1585 CE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 72 V40 L36 54 L50 28 L64 54 L78 40 V72 Z"/><path d="M22 80 H78"/><circle cx="50" cy="24" r="3"/><circle cx="22" cy="36" r="2.5"/><circle cx="78" cy="36" r="2.5"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">kingdom</p><p class="st-emblem-region